{"attributes":{"title":"Ops Overview","description":"Request/error/latency entry points via saved searches — filter by traceId from an error row for cross-service drill-down.","hits":0,"description":"Phase 10 ops dashboard (thesis + ops). Open Errors / Slow searches; copy traceId into global filter.","panelsJSON":"[{\"version\":\"8.17.3\",\"type\":\"markdown\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":48,\"h\":8,\"i\":\"1\"},\"panelIndex\":\"1\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{},\"markdown\":\"## Ops Overview\\n\\n1. Open **Errors by service** — click a row, copy `traceId`.\\n2. Add KQL filter `traceId:\\\"<id>\\\"` to see the full cross-service trail.\\n3. Use **Slow requests > 1s** for latency outliers.\\n\\nSeed traffic: `curl -H 'X-Request-ID: demo' http://localhost:8080/actuator/health`\",\"hidePanelTitles\":false}}]","optionsJSON":"{\"useMargins\":true,\"syncColors\":false,\"hidePanelTitles\":false}","version":1,"timeRestore":false,"kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"query\":\"\",\"language\":\"kuery\"},\"filter\":[]}"},"controlGroupInput":{"controlStyle":"oneLine","chainingSystem":"HIERARCHICAL","panelsJSON":"{}","ignoreParentSettingsJSON":"{\"ignoreFilters\":false,\"ignoreQuery\":false,\"ignoreTimerange\":false,\"ignoreValidations\":false}"}},"coreMigrationVersion":"8.8.0","id":"dashboard-ops-overview","type":"dashboard","references":[],"managed":false}
{"attributes":{"title":"Pricing Analytics","description":"Thesis telemetry: PricingDecisionMade + GeminiCallCompleted.","hits":0,"panelsJSON":"[{\"version\":\"8.17.3\",\"type\":\"markdown\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":48,\"h\":10,\"i\":\"1\"},\"panelIndex\":\"1\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{},\"markdown\":\"## Pricing Analytics\\n\\nSaved searches:\\n- **Fallback pricing decisions** — `businessEvent:PricingDecisionMade` + `source:BASE_FALLBACK`\\n- **Gemini failures** — `businessEvent:GeminiCallCompleted` and `outcome` ≠ `ok`\\n\\nFor price / demand timelines, Discover on `smarthotel-*` with KQL:\\n`businessEvent:PricingDecisionMade` — fields `date`, `price`, `demandIndicator`, `multiplier`.\\n\\nGemini latency: `businessEvent:GeminiCallCompleted` → `latencyMs`.\",\"hidePanelTitles\":false}}]","optionsJSON":"{\"useMargins\":true}","version":1,"timeRestore":false,"kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"query\":\"\",\"language\":\"kuery\"},\"filter\":[]}"},"controlGroupInput":{"controlStyle":"oneLine","chainingSystem":"HIERARCHICAL","panelsJSON":"{}","ignoreParentSettingsJSON":"{\"ignoreFilters\":false,\"ignoreQuery\":false,\"ignoreTimerange\":false,\"ignoreValidations\":false}"}},"coreMigrationVersion":"8.8.0","id":"dashboard-pricing-analytics","type":"dashboard","references":[],"managed":false}
